1
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,320
Mengtejiao,

2
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,580
that's enough.

3
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,040
Wait.

4
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,650
Okay, stop running.

5
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,680
Stop messing around.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,640
Jinxi, I can't open this bottle of water.

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,000
Can you help me?

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,320
Sure.

9
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:34,640
It's nice for us to hang out like this today.

10
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,120
Here.

11
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:35,720
Of course.

12
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,240
Flash.

13
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,880
Will you bring me out often in the future?

14
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,760
Thanks.

15
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,800
I know you treat me the best.

16
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,720
Good performance.

17
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,160
I'll recommend you as a trainee if there's a chance.

18
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:45,680
Let me ask you again.

19
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,280
Thank you.

20
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,120
If one day I was dying,

21
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,800
and only the magic herb on the cliff could save me,

22
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,060
would you risk your life to pick it for me?

23
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,200
Of course I would.

24
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,120
Their manager is here.

25
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,280
My baby is the best to me.

26
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:00,800
Go.

27
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,000
Then would you let me go?

28
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,680
Of course I wouldn't.

29
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,570
Then would you go secretly?

30
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:09,480
I'm asking you.

31
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,480
Of course I would go secretly.

32
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:10,960
But,

33
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,080
if you caught me going secretly,

34
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,480
would you still let me go?

35
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,490
What do you mean?

36
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,720
You just don't want to go.

37
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:17,720
You want me to die.

38
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,600
That's enough.

39
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,080
Look at how closely Sister Hu and Eason are watching.

40
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,039
You should give up.

41
00:01:26,039 --> 00:01:27,440
Come out.

42
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,570
It's you guys again.

43
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,130
Don't do this next time.

44
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,320
Delete the photos.

45
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:33,039
I haven't used my ultimate move yet.

46
00:01:33,039 --> 00:01:33,200
Let's go.

47
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,680
We'll go on a boat cruise later.

48
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:36,080
Look at that arch bridge.

49
00:01:36,759 --> 00:01:38,720
There's a camera on the arch bridge.

50
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,640
It's a camera specifically for taking pictures of tourists.

51
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:43,080
Then I just need to hold hands with Jin Xi,

52
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:45,210
and take some intimate photos.

53
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,880
This is the last time.

54
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,920
No more making a fuss after this.

55
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,800
We can just take the electric boats.

56
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,960
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

57
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,490
We can split into two boats.

58
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:00,800
No.

59
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,860
The electric boat takes four people.

60
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,760
Let's take the pedal boats.

61
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,160
The electric ones are no fun.

62
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,320
Then take the pedal boat yourself.

63
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,400
We'll take the electric one.

64
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:08,919
Feixin,

65
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,080
I'll ride with you.

66
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,160
I don't want to ride with a certain someone.

67
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,020
Suit yourself.

68
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,560
Ride it if you want to.

69
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,400
Fine, I won't.

70
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,160
You two will be fine after a little bickering.

71
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,400
I don't want to be the one breaking up the lovebirds.

72
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,800
Or I'll just end up being the joke again.

73
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,800
Come on, you two play nice.

74
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,720
What lovebirds?

75
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,520
We're just...

76
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,880
We're just sparrows.

77
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,960
Alright, I don't want to be a third wheel.

78
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,560
Jinxi and I will share a boat.

79
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,920
You should pair up with Eason.

80
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,480
He used to run marathons.

81
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,090
He's got great stamina.

82
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:34,560
Have we forgotten

83
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,320
our original purpose for coming here?

84
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,000
We're here to help the actors bond.

85
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,120
Jinxi and I will share a boat.

86
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,720
Director.

87
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,360
If Jinxi is fine with it,

88
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,560
then I'm fine with it.

89
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,940
I can do it. No problem.

90
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:50,920
The sky is so blue and the water is so green today.

91
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:52,560
Yeah.

92
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,760
It's so comfortable.

93
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,480
Yeah.

94
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,160
Look, there are egrets.

95
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,280
Don't you think

96
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:05,810
we are like the modern version of Nie Xiaoqian and Ning Caichen?

97
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,000
A little bit.

98
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,300
Look, are we almost at the bridge?

99
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,320
Jinxi.

100
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:22,200
Caichen, later when we go through the bridge arch,

101
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,480
can you hold my hand?

102
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,120
I want to feel that kind of

103
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,600
love at first sight.

104
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,560
Sure. No problem.

105
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:37,079
Why is this boat so slow?

106
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,700
Jinxi, let's hurry up.

107
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,160
Why are you pedaling so fast?

108
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,320
Did you see that boat?

109
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,320
It suddenly aroused my competitive spirit.

110
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,520
Let's compete with them

111
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,520
and see who gets through the bridge arch first.

112
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,079
Speed up.

113
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,140
What's wrong with you?

114
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:17,920
I have a cramp.

115
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,880
Hold on for a second.

116
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,840
Jinxi, grab my hand.

117
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:25,890
Speed up.

118
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,040
I'm here to pick up the photo I just took.

119
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,720
Thank you.

120
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,200
Okay.

121
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,580
Here is your photo.

122
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,980
Let's go. It's about time.

123
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,760
What's wrong?

124
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,520
Maybe

125
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,520
I got a little tired from pedaling that pedal boat.

126
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,640
Okay.

127
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,960
Don't arrange any dance moves for me tomorrow,

128
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:19,720
all right?

129
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,980
I have a hard time even walking right now.

130
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,800
What's wrong with you again?

131
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:46,880
I finally had a chance

132
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,610
to spend a whole day with Jinxi,

133
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:53,520
and I didn't even get a single photo.

134
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:58,760
I even pedaled the boat so hard.

135
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,480
It was all for nothing.

136
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,200
Sister Hu is there, and Jinxi isn't stupid.

137
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,820
Why did you have to do that?

138
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,400
You know what?

139
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,160
When I was shopping a while ago,

140
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,360
I bumped into Mike.

141
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,260
He just came up and asked me

142
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,320
why I've been working for so long

143
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,920
and still taking the bus,

144
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,880
too cheap to even take a cab.

145
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:25,360
But I really can't afford it.

146
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,160
I feel so bad.

147
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,920
Who is Mike?

148
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,480
That jerk.

149
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,400
Isn't he Lucas?

150
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:36,440
Not Lucas.

151
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,080
Lucas was last month.

152
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,120
Mike was last year.

153
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,320
Is he the lawyer with glasses?

154
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,080
No.

155
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,400
That's my crush, Jun.

156
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:47,080
We're not dating.

157
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,840
He's afraid of intimacy.

158
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,659
How many times have I told you?

159
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,700
From childhood until now,

160
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,840
your taste in men has never changed.

161
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:01,120
But I just want to be a little willful in love.

162
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:04,360
I can't even do a good job at work,

163
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,360
and my career isn't going anywhere.

164
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:10,200
Can't I be willful in my relationships?

165
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,400
It's so hard.

166
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,400
Come.

167
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:19,160
Take it easy.

168
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,380
Come on.

169
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,360
Think about it.

170
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:29,080
Of all our classmates who studied musicals together,

171
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:31,080
how many are still in this industry?

172
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:34,040
Only we are still sticking to this profession.

173
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:39,400
But Ning Jin, you don't understand.

174
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,360
You can write lyrics.

175
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,850
You can write songs.

176
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,659
You can also direct plays.

177
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,680
Old Wu can't do without you.

178
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,440
But I'm an actor.

179
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,800
Actors are easily replaceable.

180
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,040
I'm already

181
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:56,040
twenty-eight years old.

182
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,240
I know how old you are.

183
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:01,040
But I don't want to say it out loud.

184
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,120
You see how easily actors are replaced.

185
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,920
Even Wang Jianshe got replaced.

186
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,640
You are irreplaceable in my heart.

187
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,760
Stop comforting me.

188
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,040
The more you comfort me,

189
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,880
the worse I feel.

190
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,440
You know,

191
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:22,040
every time before you finish writing my songs,

192
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,900
I suffer from internal friction.

193
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,160
I...

194
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,880
I don't want to embarrass you.

195
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:30,290
I don't want to fake a relationship for clout either.

196
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,039
But if I don't work hard

197
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:34,280
and make some progress in my career,

198
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:37,600
I'm afraid you'll give up on me too.

199
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,039
Would you?

200
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,480
I won't abandon you.

201
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:41,940
Really.

202
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,039
And I believe

203
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:46,600
that one day the whole world will know that you, Bai Feixin,

204
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:49,560
are the most outstanding musical actor.

205
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,720
Stop comforting me.

206
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:55,200
The more you comfort me, the worse I feel.

207
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,600
Help me clean up the packages.

208
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,560
I opened them but haven't cleaned up yet.

209
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,600
Okay, I'll do it.

210
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,280
Don't cry.

211
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,130
The socks haven't been washed yet.

212
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,080
And this.

213
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:24,970
I don't want to fake a relationship for clout either.

214
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,720
But if I don't work hard

215
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,960
and achieve something in my career,

216
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:32,280
I'm afraid you'll give up on me too.

217
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,240
Just like Feixin.

218
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,240
Xiaoqian's pain also comes from self-doubt.

219
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,040
Great job, Feixin.

220
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,240
He's here.

221
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:08,960
Jinxi is here.

222
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:09,800
He's here.

223
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:12,480
Jinxi!

224
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:13,520
Get ready.

225
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:15,080
Jinxi, Jinxi!

226
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,440
Your charm is invincible!

227
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:19,800
We love you whether you act or not!

228
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,210
Listen to me.

229
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:26,320
Jinxi

230
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,320
wants to focus on rehearsals these days.

231
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,680
It's fine for us to stay here.

232
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,560
But let's keep a low profile, okay?

233
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,040
Okay!

234
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,640
Look at you all.

235
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,720
Have you finished your homework?

236
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,280
Have you memorized your vocabulary?

237
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:40,880
Did you pass your final exams?

238
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:42,000
Chasing stars around here.

239
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:42,720
I feel so...

240
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,090
What?

241
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:51,080
These are all good schools!

242
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,840
Of course.

243
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,760
He gave us all the motivation.

244
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:56,800
Jinxi, Jinxi, your charm is invincible!

245
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,200
We love you whether you act or not!

246
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:08,720
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

247
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:16,920
Two, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

248
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,360
Go.

249
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:20,560
Three, two, three,

250
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:25,400
four, five, six, seven, eight.

251
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:28,440
Four, two, three.

252
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,200
Stop.

253
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,240
Ning Caichen,

254
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,370
your eyes are wrong.

255
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,040
My eyes?

256
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:39,120
You're looking at Nie Xiaoqian,

257
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,480
not glaring at her.

258
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,960
This is the scene where Ning Caichen and Nie Xiaoqian first meet.

259
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:47,200
Ning Caichen falls in love with Nie Xiaoqian at first sight.

260
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,860
You need to show that flutter.

261
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,920
I don't see any flutter in your eyes.

262
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,860
I'll try again.

263
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,060
Come on.

264
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:56,880
Go.

265
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:03,640
Three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

266
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:07,920
Three, two, three, four,

267
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:11,520
five, six, seven, eight.

268
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:15,600
Let's put the blocking on hold for now.

269
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,730
Come on. Two of you bring two chairs up.

270
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,480
Sit facing each other.

271
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,080
Brother.

272
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,440
Let's just practice

273
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,640
the eye contact part.

274
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:33,280
Ning Caichen looks at Nie Xiaoqian.

275
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:35,730
Feel it with your heart.

276
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:40,440
It's the first time he sees such a beautiful,

277
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,280
gentle,

278
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,640
and mysterious girl.

279
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,200
He suddenly feels

280
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,880
an unprecedented flutter in his heart.

281
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,180
He wants to look at her,

282
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,080
but he doesn't dare.

283
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:58,920
But his eyes

284
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:02,840
follow her involuntarily.

285
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,600
When he looks at her,

286
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:11,040
his heartbeat becomes heavier

287
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,080
and beats faster and faster,

288
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,040
faster and faster,

289
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,970
so fast that he can barely breathe.

290
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:18,690
Look.

291
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:20,520
Director,

292
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:20,960
I'm getting cross-eyed.

293
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:21,760
Look closely.

294
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:28,520
Let's stop our rehearsal

295
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,250
here for now.

296
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,420
Bai Feixin,

297
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,680
bring the stool back.

298
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:37,980
How about this?

299
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:40,730
Let's pause the rehearsal for now.

300
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,040
Jin Xi,

301
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:46,400
you can give a life story presentation.

302
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,860
Just talk about your relationship history.

303
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:52,200
Let's all help you find that feeling of a crush.

304
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:54,440
Sorry.

305
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:57,000
Everyone knows our situation.

306
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:59,740
It's not very convenient to talk about this.

307
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,000
Sister Hu,

308
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,319
we are still rehearsing.

309
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:07,160
Please go out first.

310
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,319
You can't say that.

311
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,920
Mind your limits.

312
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,800
Don't worry.

313
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,010
Can we start now?

314
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,410
We can start now.

315
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,569
Then tell me about your first love.

316
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,839
My first love?

317
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:29,800
First love.

318
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:31,360
How did you meet?

319
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,340
Where did you meet?

320
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:37,140
Then tell me about the moment your heart fluttered.

321
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:38,280
How we met?

322
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:40,730
When I was young,

323
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,400
I really liked to play the guitar on the school rooftop.

324
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,930
Sometimes I would fall asleep while playing.

325
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:49,680
Then I heard a girl shouting out loud,

326
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,800
saying that four guys were always bullying her.

327
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,880
Then she said she definitely wouldn't compromise,

328
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:56,810
and definitely wouldn't yield to these evil forces.

329
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,040
And then?

330
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:03,240
And then I was one of those four men.

331
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,160
And then I greeted her.

332
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:07,720
She was startled when she saw me.

333
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:09,200
Her cheeks flushed slightly.

334
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,800
I don't think she hates me.

335
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:13,600
You're talking about a scene from Meteor Garden, right?

336
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:14,040
No.

337
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,520
I have another buddy.

338
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,010
My buddy also likes her.

339
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,600
And then as soon as he sees a girl cry...

340
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:19,800
All he can do is pull-ups.

341
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,460
I know this.

342
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,800
When you are sad, do a handstand.

343
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:26,200
Then the tears won't fall.

344
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,260
Isn't this the plot of Meteor Garden?

345
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,080
Jinxi,

346
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,690
can you tell everyone your real story?

347
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:36,400
The truth is,

348
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,360
we met in the library.

349
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:39,890
That day,

350
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:42,480
the breeze blew across the pages of her book.

351
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,000
Then,

352
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,960
she stood behind the white sheer curtain,

353
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:46,720
partially hidden.

354
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,560
I've seen it.

355
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,280
I really, really like this movie.

356
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:49,920
It's called...

357
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:50,560
"Love Letter".

358
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:50,960
Right?

359
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,040
Jinxi.

360
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:55,800
It's real.

361
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,920
It's real, okay?

362
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,760
I...

363
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,620
The day I confessed to her,

364
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:03,880
I took her to the bridge at school.

365
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,810
And I didn't tell her, "I like you."

366
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,160
I told her to close her eyes.

367
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,040
Then I said to her,

368
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,640
"If you jump off this bridge,

369
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,040
then I'll jump with you."

370
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:11,880
You jump,

371
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,120
I jump.

372
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,200
Alright, alright.

373
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,200
Come back, you two.

374
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,480
You've seen this too.

375
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:24,480
I thought you only watched high art.

376
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:25,880
Jin Xi.

377
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:28,740
We don't have time to waste with you here.

378
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:31,720
Sorry, Director.

379
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:33,000
I didn't mean it.

380
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:35,560
I don't care if you're some male star out there

381
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,730
or if you signed some contract.

382
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,360
Here with me,

383
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,120
you're just an actor.

384
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:44,920
I hope you can face yourself honestly

385
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:47,240
and face all of us sincerely.

386
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:49,060
We're all sitting here

387
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:50,880
to help you find that spark.

388
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:53,410
not here to listen to your lies.

389
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,740
Do you understand?

390
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:57,410
Think again.

391
00:19:59,520 --> 00:19:59,850
Okay.

392
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:01,720
I promise everything

393
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,330
I say from now on is true.

394
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,360
My drama 'Huayue Zhuan' was broadcast.

395
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,420
As everyone knows,

396
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:11,220
many people are attacking me online.

397
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:13,330
I don't care during the day,

398
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:15,660
but I still feel a little sad at night.

399
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,600
So I went out for a walk

400
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,800
and came to a jazz bar.

401
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:20,520
Stop.

402
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:24,520
Jin Xi.

403
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:28,720
I believe you have had many romantic experiences,

404
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:31,520
you don't have to talk about something so recent.

405
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,360
Talk about something from the past.

406
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:33,160
No, Director.

407
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:34,880
I want to talk about this one.

408
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:35,480
Director,

409
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,460
let him talk if he wants to.

410
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:39,440
Go on.

411
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,800
The jazz bar had dim lighting,

412
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,200
and it was for members only.

413
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,040
Nobody knew me.

414
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:46,600
So it became a secret base

415
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:48,200
for me as an ordinary person.

416
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:51,200
Then I noticed a girl.

417
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,200
She played a song

418
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:55,920
that deeply drew my attention.

419
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,760
What song did that girl sing?

420
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:01,640
She sang...

421
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,120
Um...

422
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:04,520
Today's rehearsal has gone on for a long time.

423
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:05,680
Let's take a break.

424
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:06,960
Don't, Director.

425
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:08,320
I'm just getting into it.

426
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:08,840
Go on.

427
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,280
What girl?

428
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:12,520
I saw the girl's back on the stage,

429
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:13,560
swaying,

430
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:14,620
like she was drunk.

431
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:16,960
But she didn't play a single wrong note.

432
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:21,480
I went up on a whim to play a duet with her.

433
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:24,120
Then...

434
00:21:24,120 --> 00:21:26,680
This story sounds like you made it up.

435
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:28,040
Director, I think what Jin Xi said

436
00:21:28,040 --> 00:21:28,880
is coherent.

437
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,760
With details and visuals,

438
00:21:29,760 --> 00:21:30,620
it must be true.

439
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,480
Jin Xi,

440
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:32,680
don't listen to the director.

441
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:34,200
Keep talking.

442
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,360
Although we had never met,

443
00:21:35,360 --> 00:21:36,760
we were surprisingly in sync.

444
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:37,480
After finishing the song,

445
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,880
the audience applauded.

446
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,120
Then...

447
00:21:40,520 --> 00:21:41,960
Then what?

448
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:43,840
The song ended.

449
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,800
She actually just...

450
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:47,960
Just what?

451
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,440
Hurry up and tell us!

452
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,760
She just kissed me.

453
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:52,880
Shut your mouth.

454
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,600
We are watching a live drama.

455
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:55,320
No, bro.

456
00:21:55,320 --> 00:21:56,780
That happened that night.

457
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,130
Tell us quickly.

458
00:21:58,800 --> 00:22:00,000
This is too exciting.

459
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:00,600
She just kissed you.

460
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:03,120
I wouldn't even dare to imagine a plot like this.

461
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:04,080
Let's end it here.

462
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:05,000
Don't.

463
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,000
Are you guys taking a break?

464
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:06,320
No.

465
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:07,520
I'm going to take a break first if you aren't.

466
00:22:07,520 --> 00:22:08,080
And then?

467
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:09,800
Did she not leave her contact info?

468
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:10,200
No.

469
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:11,560
I followed her out.

470
00:22:11,560 --> 00:22:13,480
I was going to ask for her contact info.

471
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,010
But she didn't give it to me.

472
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:16,600
Who is it?

473
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:18,860
She just disappeared after kissing you?

474
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,680
What a jerk. She's too casual and irresponsible.

475
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:22,960
These young people nowadays.

476
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:25,200
She's not that young.

477
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,060
Older than you?

478
00:22:26,320 --> 00:22:28,200
Then she must be very experienced.

479
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,000
A female player.

480
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:29,600
Definitely.

481
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:30,360
You're still thinking about her?

482
00:22:30,360 --> 00:22:30,880
An older woman and a younger man.

483
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:32,920
A night owl like her is definitely teasing you.

484
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:33,840
She is playing with your feelings.

485
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:36,360
Jinxi, you must protect yourself well.

486
00:22:36,360 --> 00:22:37,440
I don't think so.

487
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,840
How exciting is that!

488
00:22:41,560 --> 00:22:43,020
It's really interesting.

489
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:45,600
Okay, I got it.

490
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:46,920
We're leaving.

491
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:48,400
Bye.

492
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:49,000
Really?

493
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:49,840
Let's go together.

494
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:51,480
I was planning to diet tonight.

495
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:52,560
Okay, I'll go with you.

496
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:53,880
Just one cheat meal.

497
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:55,680
Director.

498
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:57,680
Director.

499
00:22:59,600 --> 00:23:00,200
Director.

500
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:04,520
What's up?

501
00:23:04,520 --> 00:23:07,320
I've been calling you for so long, why no response?

502
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:09,440
I'm a little tired today.

503
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:10,800
Now,

504
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:13,160
the dance framework for Ning Caichen and Ning Xiaoqian is set up.

505
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:14,240
Come and take a look.

506
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,640
Wait a minute, Qingsong.

507
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,320
It's getting late today.

508
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:21,660
Let's call it a day.

509
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:23,800
We can discuss any problems tomorrow.

510
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:25,000
What's going on?

511
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:28,120
You actually refused to work overtime.

512
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:30,280
The sun must be rising from the west.

513
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:31,160
No.

514
00:23:31,880 --> 00:23:33,120
It's the sun turning green

515
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:34,520
and rising from the west.

516
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:36,520
Qingsong,

517
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:37,980
thanks for your hard work.

518
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,260
Go back and rest early.

519
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:49,200
Jinxi,

520
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:51,580
come here for a sec.

521
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:58,200
What is it, Director?

522
00:23:58,280 --> 00:23:59,410
Take out your phone.

523
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,170
Add me on WeChat.

524
00:24:10,320 --> 00:24:10,840
Done.

525
00:24:12,040 --> 00:24:13,170
We'll talk tonight.

526
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:18,760
Good thing you told me

527
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,280
about Mr. Peng's sleazy deeds.

528
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:21,680
Then I thought about it.

529
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:23,400
Anyone hanging out with Mr. Peng every day

530
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,880
must be no good either.

531
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,120
So I went to look into Kevin.

532
00:24:28,600 --> 00:24:30,080
I asked his friends.

533
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:31,360
Sure enough.

534
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:32,850
Ning Jin.

535
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:35,130
Ning Jin.

536
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:37,960
Ning Jin.

537
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:40,440
Are you listening to me?

538
00:24:42,360 --> 00:24:42,920
As expected,

539
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:44,160
he is a total playboy.

540
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,360
He flirts with girls every day

541
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:46,520
and keeps them on the hook.

542
00:24:46,520 --> 00:24:47,080
I tell you,

543
00:24:47,080 --> 00:24:48,610
good thing you told me this.

544
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:51,160
Otherwise, your girl would have fallen into a trap again.

545
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:53,020
I haven't met many reliable ones.

546
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:27,400
Director.

547
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:32,120
Waiter.

548
00:25:32,280 --> 00:25:32,760
Hello.

549
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:35,260
Any tables available?

550
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:36,920
Yes.

551
00:25:37,280 --> 00:25:38,280
This way, please.

552
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:45,720
Hello. Sit here, please.

553
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,640
Today we...

554
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,570
What do you mean?

555
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:03,800
I...

556
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:05,980
Why did you bring up

557
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,680
what happened that night of all things?

558
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:09,680
Have you never been in a relationship?

559
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:11,410
Are you trying to embarrass me?

560
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:12,760
I'm sorry.

561
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:14,160
I had no choice.

562
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:16,690
What do you mean, you had no choice?

563
00:26:17,520 --> 00:26:18,380
Say something.

564
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,440
Say something.

565
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:26,920
You know,

566
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,930
I signed with the company when I was 18.

567
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:32,640
After that, I started doing gigs,

568
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:34,450
making records,

569
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:36,240
and then acting.

570
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,650
I was so busy working non-stop.

571
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,960
I had no time to digest all of it

572
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:42,360
before I became an adult.

573
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,360
So,

574
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:47,600
when you asked about my dating history,

575
00:26:48,080 --> 00:26:49,540
what was I supposed to say?

